@startuml purge-mode
!include theme.puml

title Purge Mode - State Machine with Relay/Damper Sequences

[*] --> Idle

state "Idle" as Idle {
    Idle : All purge relays OFF
    Idle : Normal HVAC operation
    Idle : Monitoring CO2, humidity, schedule
}

state "Purge Requested" as Requested {
    Requested : Trigger: CO2 > 1200ppm for 5min
    Requested : OR: Schedule (e.g., 06:00 daily)
    Requested : OR: Manual request (wall controller)
    Requested : OR: Post-cooking mode (humidity spike)
    Requested : Validate safety interlocks
}

state "Pre-Purge Safety Check" as SafetyCheck {
    SafetyCheck : Check R3.6 (Fire interlock) = OK
    SafetyCheck : Check R3.7 (Smoke interlock) = OK
    SafetyCheck : Check outside temp > -5°C
    SafetyCheck : Check wind speed < 50 km/h
    SafetyCheck : Timeout: 5 seconds
}

state "Stage 1: Dampers Opening" as Stage1 {
    Stage1 : **Actions:**
    Stage1 : R3.0 = ON (Purge supply damper OPEN)
    Stage1 : R3.1 = ON (Purge exhaust damper OPEN)
    Stage1 : R2.4 = ON (Fresh air intake OPEN)
    Stage1 : R2.5 = ON (Exhaust damper OPEN)
    Stage1 : R3.4 = ON (Purge indicator LED)
    Stage1 : 
    Stage1 : **Wait:** 60 seconds (damper travel time)
    Stage1 : **Verify:** Position feedback (AO 6,7 > 90%)
}

state "Stage 2: Fan Ramp Up" as Stage2 {
    Stage2 : **Actions:**
    Stage2 : R3.2 = ON (Fan high speed override)
    Stage2 : AO 0 = 10V (Supply fan 100%)
    Stage2 : AO 1 = 10V (Return fan 100%)
    Stage2 : AO 2 = 10V (Fresh air fan 100%)
    Stage2 : AO 3 = 10V (Exhaust fan 100%)
    Stage2 : 
    Stage2 : **Ramp:** 5%/sec to full speed
    Stage2 : **Wait:** 15 seconds (stabilize)
}

state "Stage 3: Purge Active" as Stage3 {
    Stage3 : **All fans at 100%, all dampers open**
    Stage3 : R3.3 = ON (Bypass valve open)
    Stage3 : Heating/Cooling DISABLED
    Stage3 : 
    Stage3 : **Duration:** Calculated by air changes
    Stage3 : Volume: 450m³ (house)
    Stage3 : Flow: 1200 m³/h at full speed
    Stage3 : Air changes needed: 3
    Stage3 : **Time: ~68 minutes** (3 × 450/1200 × 60)
    Stage3 : 
    Stage3 : **Monitoring:**
    Stage3 : CO2 trending toward outdoor baseline
    Stage3 : Supply/return ΔT acceptable
    Stage3 : No safety interlock triggers
}

state "Stage 4: Fan Ramp Down" as Stage4 {
    Stage4 : **Actions (reverse of Stage 2):**
    Stage4 : R3.2 = OFF (Remove high speed override)
    Stage4 : AO 0-3 ramp from 100% → normal setpoint
    Stage4 : **Ramp:** 10%/sec down
    Stage4 : **Wait:** 15 seconds (stabilize)
}

state "Stage 5: Dampers Closing" as Stage5 {
    Stage5 : **Actions (reverse of Stage 1):**
    Stage5 : R3.0 = OFF (Purge supply damper CLOSE)
    Stage5 : R3.1 = OFF (Purge exhaust damper CLOSE)
    Stage5 : R3.3 = OFF (Bypass valve CLOSE)
    Stage5 : R2.4/R2.5 return to normal position
    Stage5 : 
    Stage5 : **Wait:** 60 seconds (damper travel time)
    Stage5 : **Verify:** Position feedback (AO 6,7 < 10%)
}

state "Purge Complete" as Complete {
    Complete : R3.5 = ON (Purge complete signal, 5sec pulse)
    Complete : R3.4 = OFF (Purge indicator OFF)
    Complete : Log event to SQLite + MQTT publish
    Complete : Resume normal HVAC control
    Complete : **Cooldown:** 30 min before next purge allowed
}

state "Purge Aborted" as Aborted {
    Aborted : **Emergency stop sequence:**
    Aborted : All purge relays → OFF immediately
    Aborted : Fans ramp to 0% (emergency: immediate stop)
    Aborted : All dampers → fail-safe position
    Aborted : R3.4 = BLINK (fault indicator)
    Aborted : Alarm published via MQTT
    Aborted : Manual reset required
}

' ===== TRANSITIONS =====
Idle --> Requested : CO2 > 1200ppm (5min)\nOR schedule trigger\nOR manual request
Requested --> SafetyCheck : Request accepted
Requested --> Idle : Request denied\n(already in cooldown)

SafetyCheck --> Stage1 : All interlocks OK
SafetyCheck --> Aborted : Interlock FAIL\n(fire/smoke/temp)

Stage1 --> Stage2 : Dampers confirmed open\n(60s timeout or feedback)
Stage1 --> Aborted : Damper stuck\n(feedback timeout 90s)

Stage2 --> Stage3 : Fans at target speed\n(15s stabilization)
Stage2 --> Aborted : Fan fault\n(no speed feedback)

Stage3 --> Stage4 : Duration complete\nOR CO2 < 500ppm\nOR manual stop
Stage3 --> Aborted : Safety interlock\nOR equipment fault

Stage4 --> Stage5 : Fans at normal speed\n(15s stabilization)
Stage4 --> Aborted : Fan fault

Stage5 --> Complete : Dampers confirmed closed\n(60s or feedback)
Stage5 --> Complete : Timeout (90s, proceed anyway)

Complete --> Idle : After 5s complete pulse\nEnter 30min cooldown

Aborted --> Idle : Manual reset\n(admin PIN required)

' ===== NOTES =====
note right of Stage3
  **Air Change Calculation:**
  House volume: 450 m³
  Max airflow: 1200 m³/h
  Air changes/hour: 2.67
  Time for 3 changes: 67.5 min
  
  **Early termination:**
  If CO2 drops to outdoor level
  (typically ~420 ppm) before timer,
  advance to Stage 4.
end note

note left of Aborted
  **Safety Priority (highest first):**
  1. Fire interlock (R3.6 break)
  2. Smoke interlock (R3.7 break)
  3. Equipment fault (no feedback)
  4. Temperature limit exceeded
  5. Manual emergency stop
  
  **All cause immediate abort.**
end note

@enduml
